  "term": "individualism",
  "definition": "Individualism can mean an exclusive or excessive concern with one’s own interests. It also refers to the view that people’s self-directed action and pursuit of self-interest should be subject to little state restraint, with government limited mainly to maintaining order and protecting equal liberty.",
